  (text "B27-only structure with B19 lands. Same TARGET 2.54 mm / 1.5 mm land as #23 (status target).\\nP01-P08 continuous electrode geometry is adjacent, not omitted. P09/P12 are RF returns (HSGND).\\nCompression / contact travel UNVERIFIED (#29 draft, read-only). Stack-up UNVERIFIED (BOM B19).\\nB19 lands are not animal-side metal. B20 remains the wet-side barrier. No conductor into wet volume."
